6],"transform":{"translation":[2.09,0.004,-0.42]},"member":"frame","part":"support","anchor":"foot-foot-r"}],"decisions":[{"en":"Detailed model from the seed: rounded headboard and footboard, two foot posts with rail, cross rail, two side rails and the centre beam, one mid leg, three birch slat groups with their gaps and three rounded quilted mattress sections on the slat bones. Slats are drawn and therefore stay in the body.","de":"Detailmodell aus dem Startmodell: gerundetes Kopf- und Fußteil, zwei Fußpfosten mit Riegel, Querriegel, zwei Seitenholme und Mittelbalken, ein mittleres Bein, drei Birkenlattengruppen mit Fugen und drei gerundete gesteppte Matratzenteile auf den Lattenknochen. Die Latten sind gezeichnet und bleiben daher im Körper."},{"en":"Thermal: the mattress has two nested shells (10 mm quilt = body solid, foam core inside it), slats and frame are single layers. Structure: frame members, centre beam on the ground bone, slat groups, foam cores of the mattress sections as members; slat hinge pin and mattress guide pins as joints; four floor pads at the support anchors; all masses are uniform, so no mass solids.","de":"Thermik: die Matratze hat zwei verschachtelte Schalen (10 mm Steppdecke = Körper, darin der Schaumkern), Latten und Rahmen sind einzelne Schichten. Tragwerk: Rahmenteile, Mittelbalken am Bodenknochen, Lattengruppen, Schaumkerne der Matratzenteile als Stäbe; Lattenscharnierstift und Matratzenführungen als Gelenke; vier Bodenplatten an den Auflagern; alle Massen sind gleichmäßig verteilt, daher keine Massenkörper."}]},"100":{"status":"authored","denominator":100,"body":[{"id":"head","kind":"box","bone":"frame","material":"pine-timber","role":"body","tone":0.5,"size":[0.06,0.95,0.9],"cornerRadius":0.02,"transform":{"translation":[0.03,0.475,0.0]}},{"id":"foot-post","kind":"box","bone":"frame","material":"pine-timber","role":"body","tone":0.5,"size":[0.06,0.55,0.06],"cornerRadius":0.015,"transform":{"translation":[2.09,0.275,0.42]},"repeat":{